# Mail is our own server on the shared box. buddy deploy reconciles
# config/email.ts onto it (domain, DKIM, mailboxes, forwards) and publishes the
# MX, SPF, DKIM and DMARC records, so a deploy is the whole of the mail setup.
#
# Port 587 with STARTTLS, not 465. The SMTP driver opens a plain socket and
# negotiates, so implicit-TLS 465 times out after 30s with no useful error.
